source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A token in a link's visible text renders as an icon.
-- input.jira --
[(x)|http://example.com]
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="http://example.com" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"><img class="emoticon" src="/jira/images/icons/emoticons/error.png" height="16" width="16" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></a></p>
-- want.md --
[:emoticon[(x)]](http://example.com)
-- warnings.json --
[]
